body:
@asurkov Just to confirm, will inert be behind a flag in Firefox 81?

@alice Is inert still behind a feature flag in Chrome?

[Edit, April 9, 2021: Yes, [still behind a flag](https://caniuse.com/mdn-api_htmlelement_inert) in both Firefox and Chrome. The only mainstream browser that doesn't have an implementation yet is [webkit/Safari](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=165279)].
